{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "03caa563603736376ad2c416a02e5c0f96ea76c4607a4062593477506ffd7679", "ja": "さよならだけが人生だ", "zh": "人生唯有告别", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "36ca3bd1ce1ed659291e8db9a9a533b973c77cfc4901bda1bcc2e56ea1b2eca8", "ja": "プロデューサーと奈緒と共に推しの武道館\n公演にやってきた亜利沙。最高のライブに\n会場中が湧くなか、突然発表されたのは残酷\nにも「推しの引退」……。亜利沙は茫然自失\nのまま帰途につくのだった。", "zh": "和制作人、奈绪一起来到偶像的武道馆\n演出的亚利沙。正当全场因这场最棒的演唱会\n而沸腾之时，突然公布的却是残酷的\n“偶像引退”……亚利沙失魂落魄地踏上了\n回家的路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8f3a971b7d5b4395f7110964f830c60862dfdb5e166c9a4c9faa04ca9c4a48da", "ja": "（推しアイドルのライブが近づいているせいか、\n亜利沙のテンションは日を追うごとに高まっている…）", "zh": "（或许是因为推的偶像的演唱会临近了，\n亜利沙的情绪一天比一天高涨……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "de0ba015c4390e7eda0083b0eca30a879de5d8f38acccf6e762a185b0586956a", "ja": "亜利沙、今日のレッスンもキレッキレやったなぁ。\nやるやん！", "zh": "亚利沙，今天的训练也真是干劲十足啊。\n挺能干嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "4f20c823787c6fec9b19e4e304cd29a061bf279cffed5f9f86af37e8bccab539", "ja": "ムフフ～♪　なんだか最近、すごく調子が\nいいんですよね！　これもるるちゃんのおかげかと！", "zh": "嘿嘿～♪最近不知怎么的，状态特别好呢！这也多亏了露露！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "c834821cf4f36b41a7f48b72574776bbfa204150846adcbc77fff9b441c8c8a4", "ja": "ああ、そろそろやったなぁ、武道館ライブ。\nこの際やから、おもいっきり楽しんできてな！", "zh": "啊，武道馆演唱会也差不多该开始了吧。\n都到这份上了，就尽情享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "aa88f66875e0e8d767f1c043e4a6d319b261123c150b4cedb6c75b93c28bd0cb", "ja": "あ。……あのー、それなんですけど……。", "zh": "啊……那个……关于那件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "2ee556117b7448ebd92c1344e98c20a77c3eeb7a868539c13feeecf80bdcb134", "ja": "ん？　なんかあったん？", "zh": "嗯？出什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "589349e102403ed5e4dcf956f2e13f9487c5f13965326a4f1881e2e067ed6e3e", "ja": "本当はパパとママと行く予定だったんですけど、\nふたりとも急な出張が入っちゃって……。", "zh": "本来是打算和爸爸妈妈一起去的，可是他们两个人突然要出差……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "2aaef45c1166135e88fa44cff46ce1a538f03cb07af240dd4c04ad6e21b1496b", "ja": "え？　ほな亜利沙ひとりで行くん？\nなんや、もったいないなぁ。", "zh": "诶？那亚利沙要一个人去吗？\n真是的，太可惜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "ab3d39bfef3e0c5b29fb244329d113c863d696f7e169d76ebb6ceaabf00f0161", "ja": "そう！　そうなんです！　……それで、あの。\nもし良かったらなんですケド……。", "zh": "对！就是这样！……然后，那个。如果可以的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "b0f59df9a09d2833169c53562e803517f2fd40b159d7fef2827c021d8bb6d4a0", "ja": "奈緒ちゃんと{$P$}さんを\nご招待したいなぁ、なんて……。ど、どうでしょう？", "zh": "我想邀请奈绪和{$P$}先生……不知道可不可以？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "3dbe4889f2c83a17699bedeca2a5f4f9bb05e897f3a088e832efad84663a9351", "ja": "え、そんな大事なチケット、ホンマにええの？\n正直、曲もそんなに知らんニワカやけど……。", "zh": "诶，这么贵重的票，真的可以给我吗？\n说实话，我也不太了解那些歌，只是个半吊子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bc1393e2973c6ad327eb718fda2a15078605c1c73244d9eef97f5e1f07e2d700", "ja": "俺も、そこまで詳しいわけじゃないけど……。\n亜利沙は本当にいいのか？", "zh": "我也不是那么了解，只是……\n亜利沙，你真的没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "2b7acac74e4b430239a0d71c0a87b573d5e39b020861eb338308d3dd422dfdec", "ja": "全然いいんです！　おふたりにはぜひ、\nありさの「大好き」を知ってほしいんです！", "zh": "完全没问题！我特别希望两位能了解一下，亚利沙最喜欢的东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "a9f7a9fb54f0b98dec99b8c085c5083b020377eee5a97257f1dde14d36f58b19", "ja": "もちろん、急な話ですし、予定とかあるかもですし、\nムリにとは言わないんですケド……。", "zh": "当然啦，这事儿也挺突然的，说不定你们已经有安排了，我也不是非要勉强你们不可……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "d7bca80de7764def498fcaa96074a4a1efae785c3acd4b8d32ec1be9bc84da4f", "ja": "ええで！", "zh": "可以啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4c279f9812eb3b86d07f25ad4078f416777db6033065507c8f5180d16b2fff9b", "ja": "たしか、明後日だったよな？　うん、予定はないよ。\n亜利沙さえよければ、俺もぜひお願いしたいな。", "zh": "我记得是后天吧？嗯，我没有安排。  \n只要亚利沙不介意，我也很愿意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "b815e99fc710a3670d5b99e417caa55f06dfc85f2bcacfa3f4149488ea56fd12", "ja": "ええっ！　え！　え！　ホントですかぁ～！！\nありさ、ありさ感激ですぅ～！！！", "zh": "诶诶！诶！诶！真的吗～！！\n亚利沙，亚利沙太感动了～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "559c7858c8268b34df4e2f7b3a3a494ebebc1b26dbd50d7128cd799e6e3dda77", "ja": "こちらこそ、ありがとう。俺としても勉強にもなるし、\nなにより亜利沙の推しを生で見てみたい。", "zh": "我才要谢谢你。对我来说也能学到不少东西，  \n更重要的是，我也想亲眼看看亚利沙推的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "be9540dc75fc83e9bd5ea1daa834dea3346de1440c37b213b919270a697a2a69", "ja": "ここんとこ毎日推されまくって、正直私も生で見て\nみたいと思っててん。当日はよろしくな、亜利沙！", "zh": "这阵子天天被你安利，说实话我也想亲眼看看。当天就拜托你啦，亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "cf4c88674fcdbec87ddb9aa743182eaa6d15340965291c71c6e32015a2c30254", "ja": "はいっ、こちらこそ！　こちらこそ！！\nよろしくお願いしますぅ～♪", "zh": "好的！我这边才要请你多多关照！　请多多关照！！\n拜托啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1021_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f253082b574161470a4d84382cf72e03cc203b84feceff7a1dd61bd7c89596fa", "ja": "（『スパーク☆めいでん』……なんて素晴らしいんだ！\n会場の熱気もまさにスパークしている！！）", "zh": "（《Spark☆女仆》……真是太棒了！会场的热烈气氛也简直要爆发了！！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1023_audience", "source_sha256": "29399aeb4bb53357427b492c2dae7e207e4fdedb34e59f9b3d2a753c21734fbf", "ja": "ワアアァァ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "ff045aea16202905c5d11085b6e19699b4c45f26643c2451a1b202a4a0c7524b", "ja": "（さすがアイドルマニアの亜利沙が推すだけあって、\nこれは本物だ。……お、そろそろ最終ブロックだな）", "zh": "（不愧是偶像狂热者亚利沙推荐的，\n这确实是真货。……哦，差不多要到最后一段了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1025_audience", "source_sha256": "b2a3b1a160623b69c19e896979eefc715a9482e7a5bd455bc8ba5451d3383afb", "ja": "ワアアァァァァアアアア！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "c0cac3532abb794b237488e114635e5a1e6d5ea7f12b7de678a033229dd6a0a2", "ja": "あ、るるちゃん！　るるちゃん～！！！\nはわわわっ！　神！　神！　しゅきぃ～！！！！", "zh": "啊，露露！露露～！！！\n哈哇哇！神！神！超喜欢你～！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1027_rurutyan", "source_sha256": "d1b9787291f022c47186cb5e341e2fe7338a2f665ad20219627d12c6bf9e9c06", "ja": "みんな、声援ありがとう！\n……今日はみんなに、お知らせしたいことがあります。", "zh": "大家，谢谢你们的助威！\n……今天有件事想告诉大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "187321829ced0d61bdefdf82a0d152dbbd36e8aa11d4b4927d44865b929c01fe", "ja": "……む！？", "zh": "……嗯！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1029_rurutyan", "source_sha256": "af029931f4c99f98fdcf90d8256d896ff057698d467717c528e5eb97cb42da88", "ja": "私、『スパーク☆めいでん』のるるは、\n卒業しまーす！", "zh": "我，『スパーク☆めいでん』的瑠瑠，\n毕业啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1030_audience", "source_sha256": "045ff6eb3f69f44392164a6b1f135d6efc5611d6016950cbcbfd2f362728c454", "ja": "ええええええええーーーー！？！？！？！？", "zh": "诶诶诶诶诶诶诶诶——！？！？！？！？！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1031_p", "source_sha256": "0e9a88b78853257c5ca02fd331678352d916e45b49e6803ea20bc2cb829802a7", "ja": "（な……！？）", "zh": "（什……！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1034_037nao", "source_sha256": "00394ba4e42547e2dcae1cc740a078a364ed6d840c50abffc389ec2315bb5e94", "ja": "あ、亜利沙……？　大丈夫？", "zh": "啊、亚利沙……？你没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1036_037nao", "source_sha256": "02dfae74c902423ffe3ffc3fb2307e1c46c934c42f8d58bf27ce02d34bdeb284", "ja": "亜利沙、顔色やばいで！？\nちょ、ちょっと、脈ある？", "zh": "亚利沙，你脸色很糟糕啊！？\n等、等一下，还有脉搏吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1037_p", "source_sha256": "4983476da574cb67e8ec5eb8b4719291044a53c70030f7e59b6bdef556612a68", "ja": "亜利沙！　具合悪いか？\nダメそうなら、スタッフを呼んで……。", "zh": "亚利沙！身体不舒服吗？\n要是不行的话，就叫工作人员过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "d11fea7948bfc5cae9208b5ed37c7ac0036ea0b850e33bdfa417fb5c4295c6e0", "ja": "いえ…………大丈夫です。", "zh": "没…………我没事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1040_028ari", "source_sha256": "7d313dda4682ce332a6f47e02f0d59ae559678e4d3db78eb41ca1b10b2aaab11", "ja": "…………そっか。", "zh": "…………这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1042_037nao", "source_sha256": "37694dab2aeeac6ec0c01877008f4037fd7b5394b8a2e3c9321e6d07c1807705", "ja": "なあ亜利沙、ホンマに一人で帰れるん？\nアレやったら家まで送るで……？", "zh": "喂，亚利沙，你真的能一个人回去吗？\n要不然我送你回家……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1043_028ari", "source_sha256": "9f5bb4620764b006eeed0b3f0667d6c3b90b443182dce1acdab0d94be4ad6592", "ja": "……ハハッ。……だいじょう、ぶ、ですよ……？", "zh": "……哈哈。……我没、事、的哦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1044_028ari", "source_sha256": "c0833fa1d6589bc542be374fa6717fcd94e57aa3fe30e6da99e6d9752dc5fb3a", "ja": "……あの。……ちょっとだけ、一人にしてください。\n大丈夫、大丈夫、なので……。", "zh": "……那个……请让我一个人待一会儿。\n没事，没事的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1045_028ari", "source_sha256": "effa3da7c314a4f425aca0b79c039df263708fcb8a56f33f958e334f48289db6", "ja": "では……、また……。", "zh": "那么……再见……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1046_037nao", "source_sha256": "9dac06ff85e19e9bc68f6fb7f7b1a57ac4e0bf632f23e0db9c3f14d8ce69ea62", "ja": "あ……。亜利沙……。", "zh": "啊……亚利沙……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_03_1047_p", "source_sha256": "76f7c670a2a862c865a41bd4f819ab417a44deb14992d2d1d5010157265766bc", "ja": "（気丈に振舞おうとしているが相当ショックを受けてい\nるようだ。何か俺たちにできることはないのか……）", "zh": "（虽然她努力想表现得坚强，但看来受到了相当大的打击。我们究竟有没有什么能为她做的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
